    - target: {fileID: 1307555359423746266, guid: 5c588321741cdab47ad01a50644dd5d7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[0].text
      value: Well, howdy there, partner! Sheriff Sans is the name, I keep the peace
        here in House A.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1307555359423746266, guid: 5c588321741cdab47ad01a50644dd5d7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[2].text
      value: I hear you're the Sound Keeper. Think you can lend a hand and put our
        folks back together?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1307555359423746266, guid: 5c588321741cdab47ad01a50644dd5d7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[3].text
      value: Sure! Let's do it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1307555359423746266, guid: 5c588321741cdab47ad01a50644dd5d7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[4].text
