    - target: {fileID: 6788318501258618676, guid: 37a1313028abde14e9e7557bd93148ef, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcName
      value: Penny Cil
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6788318501258618676, guid: 37a1313028abde14e9e7557bd93148ef, type: 3}
      propertyPath: interactionRange
      value: 6
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6788318501258618676, guid: 37a1313028abde14e9e7557bd93148ef, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6788318501258618676, guid: 37a1313028abde14e9e7557bd93148ef, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[2].text
      value: It makes me so sad. I get scared I'll get it wrong, so sometimes I just...
        stop trying.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6788318501258618676, guid: 37a1313028abde14e9e7557bd93148ef, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[3].text
      value: Wait, are you the Sound Keeper? Maybe... maybe if we work together,
        I can remember again?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6788318501258618676, guid: 37a1313028abde14e9e7557bd93148ef, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[4].text
      value: "Let\u2019s give it a try!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6788318501258618676, guid: 37a1313028abde14e9e7557bd93148ef, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[5].text
      value: Or... I *used* to be. Ever since the mush-mush curse, I forgot how to
        spell! Even easy words just slip right away.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6788318501258618676, guid: 37a1313028abde14e9e7557bd93148ef, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[4].speaker
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6788318501258618676, guid: 37a1313028abde14e9e7557bd93148ef, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[5].speaker
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6788318501258618676, guid: 37a1313028abde14e9e7557bd93148ef, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLinesAfterSolved.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6788318501258618676, guid: 37a1313028abde14e9e7557bd93148ef, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLinesAfterSolved.Array.data[0].text
      value: What to do now?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6788318501258618676, guid: 37a1313028abde14e9e7557bd93148ef, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLinesAfterSolved.Array.data[1].text
      value: Talk to Pip on where to next.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6788318501258618676, guid: 37a1313028abde14e9e7557bd93148ef, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLinesAfterSolved.Array.data[0].speaker
